<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.huffmanwrites.chiefs-weekly-report</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>/Users/prh/Developer/huffmanwrites/scripts/chiefs-weekly-report-runner.sh</string>
  </array>
  <!-- Tuesday 18:30 CT, per Philip (2026-09-25): "Every Tuesday, at 1830 CT,
       publish a comprehensive report on the Kansas City Chiefs."

       Weekday 2 is Tuesday. Evening rather than morning because Monday Night
       Football is a weekly fixture: a Tuesday-morning run would report a week
       whose game had kicked off twelve hours earlier, and the final score, the
       injury news, and the press conferences all land Tuesday afternoon. 18:30
       is after the coach's Monday-review press availability and after the first
       injury report, which is what the report's two most substantive sections
       are built on.

       No conflict with the existing schedules: the docket-watch fires at 07:30
       and 18:30 daily, so this job and that one overlap on the minute. That is
       harmless — one reads CourtListener, the other reads ESPN, and neither
       writes anything the other touches — but it is worth knowing when reading
       a log with both jobs' lines in it.

       Season-only behavior is in the RUNNER, not here, and deliberately so. The
       runner asks the league for its own calendar and exits 0 during the Off
       Season phase. Hardcoding a month range in this file would need an annual
       edit and would go quietly stale; the runner's guard rolls over with the
       schedule, and a stale schedule is exactly the failure mode this repo's
       plist gate exists to catch.

       This job PUBLISHES. It is the only scheduled report here that commits and
       pushes its own output; see scripts/chiefs-weekly-report-runner.sh for what
       that changes about the verification order. -->
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Weekday</key>
    <integer>2</integer>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>18</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>30</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/prh/Developer/huffmanwrites</string>
  <!-- Keep the exported PATH used by the other huffmanwrites jobs so claude,
       hugo, python3, git and the keychain-backed helpers resolve the same way.
       SimpleBrain is a second repo this job writes to; it is reached by absolute
       path from the runner, not by anything in this environment. -->
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/Users/prh/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/prh</string>
  </dict>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/prh/Library/Logs/chiefs-weekly-report.out.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/prh/Library/Logs/chiefs-weekly-report.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
